      "writtenOn": "2026-09-07T09:20:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The input command is only checked for empty string. In my opinion, there should be additional checks to prevent commands such as `rm -rf /` from executing.\nSuggestions:\nValidate that i_ubootVariable contains only alphanumeric characters and underscores: `std::all_of(i_ubootVariable.begin(), i_ubootVariable.end(), [](char c){ return std::isalnum(c) || c \u003d\u003d \u0027_\u0027; })`",
      "revId": "137a8c0b67016d8c0378fd8dd6096d8f1e63e01c",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "74f13dfc_56d58c28",
        "filename": "vpd-tool/include/tool_utils.hpp",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 1315,
      "author": {
        "id": 1001845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-07T10:23:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my opinion the caller should be aware what input he is providing.",
      "parentUuid": "59e8eec3_27ffb40d",
      "revId": "137a8c0b67016d8c0378fd8dd6096d8f1e63e01c",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
