        "id": 1002186
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-07T15:13:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think each API should sanitize it\u0027s input. Since this API executes shell commands, it needs additional safeguards. This is especially important since `vpd-tool` is a user driven or script driven tool and user can execute malicious commands using such methods.",
      "parentUuid": "74f13dfc_56d58c28",
      "revId": "137a8c0b67016d8c0378fd8dd6096d8f1e63e01c",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "629ad3b0_b92e75c6",
        "filename": "vpd-tool/include/tool_utils.hpp",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 1315,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000522
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-07T16:25:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is an API to assume that the passed string will be a valid system command and execute that system command. It is not supposed to be restricted to any specific command.\nSo IMO, if the user is willing to run rm -rf, so be it.",
      "parentUuid": "2056c1b4_d8d7652c",
      "revId": "137a8c0b67016d8c0378fd8dd6096d8f1e63e01c",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
